 3→// Light theme overrides for Taiga UI CSS custom properties
 4→[tuiTheme='light'] {
 5→  // Backgrounds
 6→  --tui-background-base: #{gt.$neutral-white};
 7→  --tui-background-base-alt: #{gt.$neutral-light};
