 1→// Guitar Trainer color palette (bunny.net inspired)
 2→
 3→// Primary blues
 4→$primary-blue: #183d6d;
 5→$primary-dark: #052740;
 6→$primary-darker: #051e38;
 7→$primary-blue-light: #2a5a9a;
 8→
 9→// Accent orange (gradient endpoints)
10→$accent-orange: #fd8d32;
11→$accent-orange-light: #ffaf48;
12→
